---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import ProjectCard from '../../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import projects from '../../data/projects.json';import {projectsCheckedAt} from '../../lib/projects';import {path} from '../../site';
const groups=[{name:'正在构建',statuses:['active','exploring']},{name:'持续维护',statuses:['maintained']},{name:'已发布与过去项目',statuses:['published','paused']}];
---
<Base title="项目 · 海波东"><div class="projects-page"><header class="connection-heading"><span class="eyebrow">从想法到实践 / PROJECTS</span><h1>项目</h1><p>一些正在构建、已经完成和持续维护的东西。</p></header>{groups.map(group=>{const items=projects.filter(p=>group.statuses.includes(p.status));return items.length>0&&<section class="project-section"><div class="editorial-heading"><h2>{group.name}</h2><span>{String(items.length).padStart(2,'0')}</span></div><div class="project-grid">{items.map(project=><ProjectCard project={project}/>)}</div></section>})}<div class="project-outro"><p>项目之外，还有一些正在研究的问题。</p><a class="text-link" href={path('build/')}>看看能一起做什么 →</a></div><p class="connection-note">GitHub 数据快照更新于 {projectsCheckedAt.slice(0,10)}，Star 与仓库更新时间以快照为准。</p></div></Base>
